    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i'm trying to report a streetlamp that's acting up near the corner of glenwood rd and bush lane. it keeps flickering every single day around 4pm but then stays on fine the rest of the time. how do i lodge a formal report for this and how long does it usually take to get someone out to look at it?",
